'''The Electric Tale of Pikachu issue 4''' is the fourth monthly issue of the manga series [[The Electric Tale of Pikachu]] to be released by [[VIZ Media]]. It contains the fourth chapter of the manga, ''[[ET04|Haunting My Dreams]]''. 

This issue was included as part of {{vol|Electric Tale of Pikachu|1}} along with [[ET01]], [[ET02]], and [[ET03]].

